msgctxt "76"
msgid "Thank you so much, Kiryu-san. I don't know what I would've done without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "You're a wonderful man... I don't know how I can repay you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Just doing what needs to be done. Don't think too hard about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "And Nao... I'm sorry... I never meant to get you caught up in this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "It's okay, Mom. I understand now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"...I don't think I've told you this, but your father... He proposed to me "
"when I was twenty-five."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "And you know what he always wanted?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"To give you the finest bingata kimono our workshop could possibly produce "
"by the time you turned that age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Now, I know your father's no longer with us, but the love he had for you "
"will never fade away. And I wanted to honor that wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Mom..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I'm still not as good as I want to be at crafting these things, so I "
"couldn't quite make it by your birthday..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"But the special bingata I've been working on just for you...\r\n"
"It's already been sent to the tailor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Hehe. Honestly, I wanted to keep it a secret until it was ready to present "
"to you... Guess I'm not good at hiding things, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Mom... You don't have to say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "No... I do. I'm so sorry, Nao... for everything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"*sob* And I'm sorry, too... I never tried to understand things from your "
"perspective at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "...I hope you can forgive me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "So it all worked out in the end, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Yes... And I owe you a big thank-you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"All I want is to see your kimono when it's finished. Can you make that "
"happen for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Of course! You'll be the first person I show, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You've helped me out so many times now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "If you hadn't shown up today... I hate to think what would've happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Then don't. I'll be there whenever you need me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Then... Let me show you my appreciation... in a way only I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"The only thing is... it'd require you spending just a little more time with "
"me than usual. In a place where the only eyes on us are each other's. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

